    "Support": {
      "description": "How much a relationship no link covers must be backed before a person may have a new link\ndrafted for it ([`Brief::Link`]): at least `docs` documents and `quotes` reviews, each\nreview one quote. A thinner one stays a finding, shown but never briefed: on real data most\nsuch relationships are relations the gold never labels, and a link drafted for them states\nnothing a person asked for (P5.14).\n\nA person's [`Brief::Link`] is offered only for a finding [`Support::NEW_LINK`] admits, and\nits draft is only ever queued for a person to approve ([`crate::Tier::Queue`]), never\napplied alone. Every finding has two documents (P5 D10), and a document gives a\nrelationship one review at least, so a support asks no fewer of either: [`Support::new`]\nrefuses one that would admit what no finding is.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "docs": {
          "description": "The documents it needs.",
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "uint64",
          "minimum": 1
        },
        "quotes": {
          "description": "The reviews it needs, each one quote.",
          "type": "integer",
          "format": "uint64",
          "minimum": 1
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "docs",
        "quotes"
      ]
    }
  }
